  "messages": [
    {
      "content": "Solve this problem step by step. Put your final answer within \\boxed{}.\n\nWhat percentage younger is Nani's sister than Nani? Nani is 9 years old. Nani's sister is 20% younger than Nani.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Nani’s sister is stated to be **20% younger** than Nani.\n\nTo verify:\n\n- Nani’s age: \\(9\\) years\n- Sister’s age: \\(9 \\times (1-0.20)=7.2\\) years\n- Difference: \\(9-7.2=1.8\\) years\n- Percentage younger:\n\n\\[\n\\frac{1.8}{9}\\times 100\\%=20\\%\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{20\\%}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Wait, I made a mistake. Nani is 8 years old.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Nani’s sister is still **20% younger**, since that percentage is given.\n\nHer age is:\n\n\\[\n8 \\times (1-0.20)=8 \\times 0.8=6.4\n\\]\n\nSo Nani’s sister is \\(1.6\\) years younger, and:\n\n\\[\n\\frac{1.6}{8}\\times 100\\%=20\\%\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{20\\%}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Actually, that was wrong. Nani's sister is 25% younger than Nani.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Nani is \\(8\\) years old, and her sister is \\(25\\%\\) younger.\n\n\\[\n8 \\times 25\\% = 8 \\times 0.25 = 2\n\\]\n\nHer sister is \\(2\\) years younger, so her age is:\n\n\\[\n8-2=6\n\\]\n\nTherefore, the percentage younger is:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{25\\%}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Oh, I forgot to mention: Nani's sister's age is compared with Nani's age using Nani's age as the reference.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Using Nani’s age as the reference:\n\n- Nani’s age: \\(8\\) years\n- Sister’s age: \\(25\\%\\) younger\n- Difference:\n\n\\[\n0.25 \\times 8 = 2\\text{ years}\n\\]\n\nSo her sister is \\(8-2=6\\) years old. The percentage younger, relative to Nani’s age, is:\n\n\\[\n\\frac{8-6}{8}\\times 100\\%\n=\\frac{2}{8}\\times 100\\%\n=\\boxed{25\\%}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Great. Now let's take that a step further. How old will Nani be when her sister turns 10? Also, here's some relevant info: Nani's sister is currently 6 years old.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Nani is currently \\(8\\) and her sister is \\(6\\), so the age difference is:\n\n\\[\n8-6=2\\text{ years}\n\\]\n\nWhen her sister turns \\(10\\), \\(4\\) years will have passed:\n\n\\[\n6+4=10\n\\]\n\nNani will then be:\n\n\\[\n8+4=\\boxed{12\\text{ years old}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Here's another detail: Nani and her sister will age by one year each year.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Since Nani and her sister each age by one year every year, their age difference remains \\(2\\) years:\n\n\\[\n8-6=2\n\\]\n\nWhen Nani’s sister turns \\(10\\), Nani will be:\n\n\\[\n10+2=\\boxed{12\\text{ years old}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Good, now using that, can you calculate: What is the total age of Nani, Nani's brother, and Nani's sister? By the way, Nani's brother is twice Nani's age.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "When Nani’s sister turns \\(10\\), Nani will be \\(12\\).\n\nNani’s brother is twice Nani’s age:\n\n\\[\n2 \\times 12=24\n\\]\n\nSo the total age is:\n\n\\[\n12+10+24=\\boxed{46\\text{ years}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    }
  ],
